# 00-project-control/registers/

Project registers. Tracking files, not numbered.

| File                            | Purpose                                                |
| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `document-register.md`          | Master list of every project document and its owner    |
| `document-completion-matrix.md` | Document × phase × maturity matrix                     |

Source of truth for document inventory is `.harness/documents.yml`.
This folder presents the human-readable view.
